- Hey guys.

01:04:16.183 --> 01:04:18.240
Thank you so much for
watching my video on YouTube.

01:04:18.240 --> 01:04:20.040
I wanted to jump in here at the end

01:04:20.040 --> 01:04:22.480
because I'm working on a
ridiculously important project

01:04:22.480 --> 01:04:23.313
for me

01:04:23.313 --> 01:04:24.836
and I have a funny feeling you can help.

01:04:24.836 --> 01:04:26.720
If you drink wine at all

01:04:26.720 --> 01:04:28.640
or know anybody that drinks wine at all,

